 ENDF/B-VI MOD 1 Evaluation, November 1989, D. Hetrick,           2434 1451
                 D.C. Larson, N.M. Larson, and C.Y. Fu (ORNL)     2434 1451
                                                                  2434 1451
   This work employed nuclear model codes including the           2434 1451
Distorted Wave Born Approximation (DWBA) Program DWUCK [Ku72]     2434 1451
and the Hauser-Feshbach code TNG [Fu88,Fu80,Sh86].  The TNG code  2434 1451
provides energy and angular distributions of particles emitted in 2434 1451
the compound and pre-compound reactions, ensures consistency among2434 1451
all reactions, and maintains energy balance. Details pertinent to 2434 1451
the contents of this evaluation and comparisons of calculations   2434 1451
with experimental data can be found in [Sh87] and [He87].         2434 1451
